WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.783
This query creates January February and March
admission counts plus a total The

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:12.630
left join preserves patients with no admissions Run
the query and compare

00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:18.387
total admissions with the displayed month columns If
the dataset contains

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.203
only those months the totals should align with their
sum
